    <task id="Id_d424dbc4-6623-4413-be73-f122ca78d3b3" name="6.2 Elaborar a minuta do contrato">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 18. A fase preparat&amp;oacute;ria do processo licitat&amp;oacute;rio &amp;eacute; caracterizada pelo planejamento e deve compatibilizar-secom o plano de contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es anual de que trata o &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0000ED;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;inciso VII do &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0000ED;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;caput &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#0000ED;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;do art. 12 desta Lei&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;, sempre que elaborado, ecom as leis or&amp;ccedil;ament&amp;aacute;rias, bem como abordar todas as considera&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es t&amp;eacute;cnicas, mercadol&amp;oacute;gicas e de gest&amp;atilde;o quepodem interferir na contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, compreendidos:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;VI - a elabora&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de minuta de contrato, quando necess&amp;aacute;ria, que constar&amp;aacute; obrigatoriamente como anexo doedital de licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;Tamb&amp;eacute;m far&amp;aacute; parte do contrato o Protocolo de Infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do Projeto - PIP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;QUAIS CLAUSULAS SAO ESPECICIFICAS AOS CONTRATO DE OBRAS OU SERVICOS DE ENGENHARIA?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;O instrumento contratual padronizado traz as cl&amp;aacute;usulas necess&amp;aacute;rias ao contrato previstas na lei. No caso de obras e servi&amp;ccedil;os, o gestor dever&amp;aacute; atentar para as seguintes especificidades:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Descri&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do objeto (obra ou servi&amp;ccedil;o de engenharia) e seus elementos caracter&amp;iacute;sticos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. Vincula&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ao edital de licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e &amp;agrave; proposta do licitante vencedor ou ao ato que tiver autorizado a contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o direta e &amp;agrave; respectiva proposta;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3. Legisla&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o aplic&amp;aacute;vel &amp;agrave; execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do contrato, inclusive quanto aos casos omissos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;4. Regime de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ou forma de fornecimento;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;5. Pre&amp;ccedil;o e condi&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de pagamento; crit&amp;eacute;rios, data-base e periodicidade do reajustamento de pre&amp;ccedil;os; e, crit&amp;eacute;rios de atualiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o monet&amp;aacute;ria entre a data do adimplemento das obriga&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e a do efetivo pagamento;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;6. Crit&amp;eacute;rios e periodicidade da medi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, quando for o caso, e prazo para liquida&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e para pagamento.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;7. Prazos de in&amp;iacute;cio das etapas de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, conclus&amp;atilde;o, entrega, observa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e recebimento definitivo, quando for o caso;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;8. Cr&amp;eacute;dito pelo qual correr&amp;aacute; a despesa, com a indica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da classifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o funcional program&amp;aacute;tica e da categoria econ&amp;ocirc;mica;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;9. Matriz de risco, quando for o caso;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#C4BD97" />
